    "name":  "100W LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - 5 Years",
    "reference":  "FLOSR100W-CW-91935",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDo you want to illuminate your garden, terrace, or facade with the best quality and the lowest consumption? Then you need the \u003cstrong\u003e100W Outdoor LED Floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e- Avant Pro - OSRAM Chip.\u003c/strong\u003e This floodlight offers you powerful, even, and long-lasting light, thanks to its OSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip, one of the most advanced on the market.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this\u003cstrong\u003e floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e, you can enjoy high-performance outdoor lighting, with up to 80% savings on your electricity bill. Furthermore, its robust \u003cstrong\u003eIK10\u003c/strong\u003e design and dust- and water-resistant \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rating guarantee a long lifespan. Don\u0027t hesitate any longer, get the OSRAM Chip Floodlight, order it now and receive it quickly, plus it comes with a \u003cstrong\u003e5-YEAR WARRANTY!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e100W LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro - OSRAM Chip OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - 5 Years Warranty\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet ready to experience next generation lighting with the \u003cstrong\u003eLED Outdoor \u003cstrong\u003eFloodlight\u003c/strong\u003e - Avant Pro!\u003c/strong\u003e This stunning, state-of-the-art floodlight completely redefines your perception of brightness and energy efficiency. Precision engineered and equipped with state-of-the-art technology, this product is the perfect choice for those looking for exceptional outdoor lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of this floodlight is the renowned \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 Chip\u003c/strong\u003e, a milestone in technological innovation. Thanks to its unique cutting-edge technology, this chip delivers exceptional performance that defies conventional brightness limits. With an astounding 140 lumens per watt (Lm/W) efficiency, this projector emits dazzling, crisp light that illuminates every corner of your outdoor environment with stunning clarity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersatility meets durability in the design of the Avant Pro LED Outdoor Floodlight. Precision manufactured using a combination of high quality aluminum and durable polycarbonate, this floodlight is designed to withstand the rigors of weather and time, ensuring consistent performance for years to come. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIK10\u003c/strong\u003e rating protects against accidental impact and damage, ensuring a long-term, worry-free lighting investment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation has never been easier and safer. Equipped with an \u003cstrong\u003eIP67\u003c/strong\u003e connector, this floodlight connects to the mains quickly and efficiently, without compromising the integrity of the system. Whether illuminating gardens, facades, playgrounds or commercial spaces, this floodlight offers a lighting solution that perfectly suits your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Foco-Proyector-Exterior-LED-30W-NEW-EVOLUTION-IP65-Osram.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd that\u0027s not all, confidence is guaranteed! With a \u003cstrong\u003e5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e, you can rest assured that you are investing in a product that not only illuminates your environment, but also illuminates your peace of mind. The LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro is much more than just a floodlight; it is a statement of unmatched excellence, durability and performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlus, its instant on/off feature gives you immediate illumination with no waiting time. Whether for special events, commercial installations or home use, you won\u0027t have to worry about waiting for the lights to turn on gradually. Simply flip the switch and enjoy bright illumination instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe IP65 protection of this floodlight makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Thanks to its protection rating, it is ready to withstand harsh weather conditions, such as rain, snow or dust. So no matter whether you need it to illuminate a garden, a facade or a commercial space, this floodlight is designed to withstand and continue to perform optimally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur floodlight is IK10! Maximum resistance to shocks and inclement weather!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM CHIP LED\u003c/strong\u003e projector is versatile and can be used in a wide variety of applications. Some of the places where this projector can be used include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eArchitectural lighting: It can be used to highlight and enhance the beauty of buildings, monuments, bridges, and other architectural elements.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvertising lighting: It is ideal for illuminating billboards, posters, signs, and advertising panels, helping to capture the attention of the public and highlight information.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting: It can be employed to create decorative lighting effects at events, gardens, parks, squares, resting areas, and other outdoor spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial area lighting: It\u0027s perfect for showcasing products in exhibitions, shop windows, shopping malls, and stores, attracting customers\u0027 attention to the offered products or services.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResidential lighting: It can be used in yards, gardens, terraces, and outdoor areas of homes, providing efficient and safe lighting for nighttime activities.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial lighting: It\u0027s suitable for illuminating work areas in factories, warehouses, workshops, and industrial spaces, improving visibility and workplace safety.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecurity lighting: It can be used in security lighting systems for outdoor or indoor areas, providing bright and clear illumination to detect potential risks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe LED projector with Osram chip is an exceptional choice for those seeking quality, performance, and efficiency in lighting. Its innovative design, energy-saving capability, and versatility for indoor and outdoor use make it the ideal choice for illuminating your architectural, advertising, and decorative projects. Don\u0027t settle for less, choose cutting-edge lighting with the Avant Pro LED projector.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED, we ensure that our products are of QUALITY and provide all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT, or WHOLESALE SALE, including the technical specifications of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
